    "title": "26-year-old killed in vehicle crash in south Charlotte, police say - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Spencer Chrisman ,\n7 hours ago CHARLOTTE, N.C. (WBTV) - A 26-year-old man was killed after being involved in a vehicle crash in south Charlotte earlier this week, according to police. Charlotte police said on Tuesday, Sept. 23, around 4:50 p.m., officers responded to a report of a vehicle crash with injuries on Pineville-Matthews Road near Park Cedar Drive. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
